# Binary assets: never apply EOL conversion or diff them as text.
#
# The vendored corpus is 1,404 `.weba` files / 7,005,583 bytes whose SHA-256
# values are enforced by `scripts/vendor_corpus.py --check`. A CRLF rewrite on
# checkout would break every hash and inflate the payload, so mark it binary
# explicitly rather than relying on git's heuristic.
*.weba binary
*.wasm binary
*.f32 binary
